      "role": "user",
      "content": "24-48 hours?? i can barely stand up right now lol. the pain is literally blinding. i've had migraines for years and they usually get this intense before they peak. if i take a double dose of the sumatriptan, do you think that would help it go away faster? i really don't want to go to the clinic tonight if i can just handle it at home.",
